| Check | Expect |
|-------|--------|
| `http://127.0.0.1:8010/up` | 200 |
| `http://app.lvh.me:3000` | سایت بهرام |
| `http://club.lvh.me:3001` | خانواده (rewrite به `/family`) |
| `http://localhost:7357` | Flutter manager (optional) |
